<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN EESTI TELEFON BORROWS 320 MLN KROONS - REPORT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN EESTI TELEFON BORROWS 320 MLN KROONS - REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Telefon (Estonian Telephone) signed a five-year loan agreement worth 320 million kroons in Brussels on Friday, Aripaev newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>Some 128 million kroons is from the Nordic Investment Bank and 192 million kroons is a syndicated loan involving seven banks, the newspaper added.</p>
<p>The interest rate is DEM LIBOR plus a marginal of 0.45 percent.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
